{title: Naina}
{artist: Sohail Shahzad Saad Sultan Saba Qamar Kamli}
{key: Gm}

{c: Verse 1}
[Gm]Naina,        Naina day kol kol [D]rehna
Pal da firaaq naiyoon [D#]sehna,        [D]Naina ton durr na [Gm]karien
[Gm]Dukhrray Sunavnay,        [Gm]Beth meray [D]samnay
Din ehh [Cm]pyar waalay,        Phir kadon [Gm]aavanay
[Gm]Akkhaan,        Akkhaan na vaikh vaikh [D]thakkaan
Dil di kitaab vich [D#]rakkhaan,        [D]Akkhaan ton durr na [Gm]karien
[Gm]Naina,        Naina day kol kol [D]rehna
Pal da firaaq naiyoon [D#]sehna,        [D]Naina ton durr na [Gm]karien
[Gm]Hijraan nu dhaall vey,        Rehn day [D]visaal vey
Jindrri nay [Cm]rona paaya,        Jeena tairay [Gm]naal vey
[Gm]Sahnvaan,        Baqi nay yaar jo vi [D]Sahnvaan
Hans kay main naam tairay [D#]lavaan,        Sahnvaan chon durr na [Gm]karien
[Gm]Naina,        Naina day kol kol [D]rehna
Pal da firaaq naiyoon [D#]sehna,        [D]Naina ton durr na [Gm]karien
